# calculator.ipynb is code cells only (the driver's run index counts a markdown cell: reported to the cao): 0 snobol4, 1 icon, 2 raku. developer_06 2026-11-22 20:0x CST. EXPECTED lines are by the program (the cfo reads them): a frame waits at the line of its call, a step in enters the callee at its first STATEMENT (line 14: line 13 is the declaration local v), a step out stops in the caller at the next statement. The breakpoint at term's first statement is hit 18 times by the nine lines of input: the first stop, then 17 continues, then the run ends.
